{"id":"77234e7e1a9081ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Fredholm Operator","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Fredholm Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Fredholm Operator","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-bounded-linear]]","[[58-df-kernel-image]]","[[58-df-dimension]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator — ZFC Analysis2 Fredholm Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"261de7e0269cd7e2\" href=\"?note=261de7e0269cd7e2\" title=\"58-df-bounded-linear\">58-df-bounded-linear</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55889258754cb9d9\" href=\"?note=55889258754cb9d9\" title=\"58-df-kernel-image\">58-df-kernel-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"58-df-dimension\">58-df-dimension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,Y,F,K,I,Q,q,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V\">\\(T,X,Y,F,K,I,Q,q,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S\\)</span> (fully structured bounded-linear-operator predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"261de7e0269cd7e2\" href=\"?note=261de7e0269cd7e2\" title=\"58-df-bounded-linear\">58-df-bounded-linear</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span> (explicit field and vector-space predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Kernel}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Image}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Image}_S\\)</span> (kernel and image predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"55889258754cb9d9\" href=\"?note=55889258754cb9d9\" title=\"58-df-kernel-image\">58-df-kernel-image</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\)</span> (dimension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"522587a7fec6816a\" href=\"?note=522587a7fec6816a\" title=\"58-df-dimension\">58-df-dimension</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span> (topological closed-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set\">58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S(T,X,Y,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,K,I,Q,q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Y,F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(0_Y+_Yy=y)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\subseteq Y:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(C=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,Y,Q)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(q(y)=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(+_Q(\\langle q(y),q(z)\\rangle)=q(y+_Yz)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Q,F\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\odot_Q(\\langle a,q(y)\\rangle)=q(a\\odot_Yy)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle K,F,+_X\\upharpoonright(K\\times K),\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(F\\times K),+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X\\rangle)\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(m,\\langle Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,q(0_Y)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\land\n\\tau_Y=\\{U\\subseteq Y:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(\\lVert z-y\\rVert_Y&lt;\\varepsilon\\to z\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,I)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S(T,X,Y,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,K,I,Q,q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Y,F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(0_Y+_Yy=y)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\subseteq Y:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(C=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,Y,Q)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(q(y)=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(+_Q(\\langle q(y),q(z)\\rangle)=q(y+_Yz)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Q,F\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\odot_Q(\\langle a,q(y)\\rangle)=q(a\\odot_Yy)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle K,F,+_X\\upharpoonright(K\\times K),\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(F\\times K),+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X\\rangle)\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(m,\\langle Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,q(0_Y)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\land\n\\tau_Y=\\{U\\subseteq Y:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(\\lVert z-y\\rVert_Y&lt;\\varepsilon\\to z\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,I)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kernel and cokernel dimensions are applied to the explicit vector-space structure tuples expected by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Dimension}_S\\)</span>; the former three-place calls were ill-typed.</li>\n<li>The cokernel carrier and its quotient operations are constructed from the range, and range closedness uses the bound norm topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-linear","status":"resolved","id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-linear]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-kernel-image","status":"resolved","id":"55889258754cb9d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-kernel-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dimension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-linear","status":"resolved","id":"261de7e0269cd7e2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S$ (fully structured bounded-linear-operator predicate, see [[58-df-bounded-linear]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-kernel-image","status":"resolved","id":"55889258754cb9d9","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Kernel}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Image}_S$ (kernel and image predicates, see [[58-df-kernel-image]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dimension","status":"resolved","id":"522587a7fec6816a","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dimension}_S$ (dimension predicate, see [[58-df-dimension]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S$ (topological closed-set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,X,Y,F,K,I,Q,q,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Image}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}fredholm\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnalysis2FredholmOperator}_S(T,X,Y,F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists +_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X,0_Y,K,I,Q,q,+_Q,\\odot_Q,\\tau_Y\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Field}_S(F,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(X,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Y,F,+_Y,\\odot_Y,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_S(T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,X,Y,F,+_X,\\odot_X,+_Y,\\odot_Y)\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;(0_X+_Xx=x)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(0_Y+_Yy=y)\\land\nQ=\\{C\\subseteq Y:\\exists y\\in Y\\;(C=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(q,Y,Q)\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\;(q(y)=\\{y+_Yi:i\\in I\\})\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q,Q\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall y,z\\in Y\\;\\bigl(+_Q(\\langle q(y),q(z)\\rangle)=q(y+_Yz)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\odot_Q,F\\times Q,Q)\\land\n\\forall a\\in F\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\\bigl(\\odot_Q(\\langle a,q(y)\\rangle)=q(a\\odot_Yy)\\bigr)\\land\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F)\\land\n\\exists n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(n,\\langle K,F,+_X\\upharpoonright(K\\times K),\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(F\\times K),+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,0_X\\rangle)\\land\n\\mathrm{Dimension}_S(m,\\langle Q,F,+_Q,\\odot_Q,+_F,\\cdot_F,0_F,1_F,q(0_Y)\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\land\n\\tau_Y=\\{U\\subseteq Y:\\forall y\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall z\\in Y\\;(\\lVert z-y\\rVert_Y<\\varepsilon\\to z\\in U)\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,I)\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dimension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":3192,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-fredholm-operator]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","261de7e0269cd7e2","55889258754cb9d9","522587a7fec6816a","4dc8b2d2e69010a2","592f9cfb66a507c2","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}